---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Charlas y Eventos - LEAR"
  description="LEAR lleva su experiencia en salud y movimiento a empresas y escuelas con charlas dinámicas, semanas de la salud, activaciones especiales y rallies deportivos para evaluar rendimiento funcional."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[60vh] flex items-center bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0d4b92] via-[#1560b3] to-[#00b6e5] text-white overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Animated Background Elements -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-[#33c7ed] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20 animate-pulse"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-[#00d4aa] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-15 animate-pulse" style="animation-delay: 1s"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 md:py-24 w-full">
      <div class="text-center">
        <!-- Badge -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 rounded-full mb-8 shadow-xl">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#00d4aa] rounded-full animate-pulse shadow-lg shadow-[#00d4aa]/50"></div>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide">LLEVAMOS LEAR FUERA DE LA CLÍNICA</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black mb-6 leading-tight">
          Charlas y <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-[#66d4f1] to-white bg-clip-text text-transparent">Eventos</span><br/>
          que conectan con tu equipo
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg md:text-2xl max-w-3xl mx-auto text-white/90 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Llevamos nuestra experiencia en salud, movimiento y bienestar a empresas y escuelas
          con un formato ágil, dinámico y memorable.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ¿Qué Ofrecemos? -->
  <section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e3f0ff] via-white to-[#d9f3fc]"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-32 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/50 to-transparent"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-[#00b6e5]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 left-20 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-[#00d4aa]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00b6e5]/20 to-[#00d4aa]/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full font-bold text-sm mb-6 border-2 border-[#00b6e5]/30 shadow-lg">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#00b6e5] rounded-full animate-pulse shadow-lg shadow-[#00b6e5]"></div>
          LO QUE OFRECEMOS
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-6">
          Dos formatos pensados para tu <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0d4b92] via-[#00b6e5] to-[#00d4aa] bg-clip-text text-transparent">audiencia</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-[#475569] max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Adaptamos cada experiencia al público y a la ocasión, manteniendo siempre la energía y el aprendizaje.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
        <!-- Card A: Charlas Dinámicas -->
        <div class="group relative">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0d4b92] to-[#00b6e5] rounded-3xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>

          <div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-[#e3f0ff] rounded-3xl p-10 shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(13,75,146,0.3)] transition-all duration-500 transform hover:-translate-y-2 hover:rotate-1 border border-[#0d4b92]/10 h-full">
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
                <div class="relative">
                  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0d4b92] to-[#1560b3] rounded-3xl blur-lg opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"></div>
                  <div class="relative w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0d4b92] to-[#1560b3] rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center transform group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg">
                    <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11a7 7 0 01-7 7m0 0a7 7 0 01-7-7m7 7v4m0 0H8m4 0h4m-4-8a3 3 0 01-3-3V5a3 3 0 116 0v6a3 3 0 01-3 3z"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-4 text-center group-hover:text-[#0d4b92] transition-colors">
                Charlas Dinámicas
              </h3>
              <p class="text-[#475569] text-center leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Ideales para <strong>empresas</strong> y <strong>escuelas</strong> (Semana de la Salud).
                Charlas cortas e interactivas con dinámicas pequeñas que mantienen a la audiencia
                atenta y participativa.
              </p>

              <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-5 border border-[#0d4b92]/10">
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0d4b92] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Temas frecuentes</p>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[#475569]">
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#00b6e5] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                    Ergonomía y salud postural
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#00b6e5] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                    Prevención de lesiones
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#00b6e5] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                    Bienestar laboral y pausas activas
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#00b6e5] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                    Hábitos de movimiento para estudiantes
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card B: Dinámicas Especiales -->
        <div class="group relative">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00d4aa] to-[#ff8c42] rounded-3xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>

          <div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-[#d6f5ed] rounded-3xl p-10 shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,212,170,0.3)] transition-all duration-500 transform hover:-translate-y-2 hover:rotate-1 border border-[#00d4aa]/10 h-full">
            <div class="relative z-10">
              <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
                <div class="relative">
                  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#00d4aa] to-[#ff8c42] rounded-3xl blur-lg opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-75 transition-opacity"></div>
                  <div class="relative w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#00d4aa] to-[#ff8c42] rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center transform group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6 transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg">
                    <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-4 text-center group-hover:text-[#00d4aa] transition-colors">
                Dinámicas y Activaciones Especiales
              </h3>
              <p class="text-[#475569] text-center leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Pensadas para <strong>eventos conmemorativos</strong> como el Día de las Madres
                o celebraciones escolares. Diseñamos estaciones donde evaluamos rendimiento
                funcional a través de juegos, retos por equipos, puntos y premios.
              </p>

              <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-5 border border-[#00d4aa]/10">
                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#00d4aa] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Lo que incluye</p>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[#475569]">
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#00d4aa] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                    Competencias por equipos
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#00d4aa] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                    Retos físicos divertidos y accesibles
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#00d4aa] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                    Sistema de puntos y premios
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#00d4aa] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                    Experiencia memorable y participativa
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Caso Destacado: Colegio Jesús María Echavarría -->
  <section id="echavarria" class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#d6f5ed] via-[#d9f3fc] to-[#e3f0ff]"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-[#00b6e5] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-15"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-[#00d4aa] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-15"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00d4aa]/20 to-[#00b6e5]/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full font-bold text-sm mb-6 border border-[#00d4aa]/20">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-[#00d4aa] rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
          CHARLA EN ESCUELA
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-6">
          Semana de la Salud — <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0d4b92] to-[#00b6e5] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Colegio Jesús María Echavarría</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-[#475569] max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Nuestra primera invitación a una escuela: charlas dinámicas para distintos grupos
          combinando teoría breve, demostraciones y actividad física en grupo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8">
        <!-- Photo 1: La charla -->
        <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#e2e8f0] hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(13,75,146,0.2)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e3f0ff] to-[#d9f3fc]">
            <img
              src="/images/charlas/echavarria-charla.jpg"
              alt="Charla con LEAR en aula del Colegio Jesús María Echavarría"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#0d4b92]/10 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-[#0d4b92] mb-3">
              CHARLA
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-2">"Tu máquina perfecta"</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
              Abrimos la sesión con una charla breve sobre cómo cuidar el cuerpo desde edades tempranas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Photo 2: Audiencia -->
        <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#e2e8f0] hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,182,229,0.2)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#d9f3fc] to-[#e3f0ff]">
            <img
              src="/images/charlas/echavarria-audiencia.jpg"
              alt="Estudiantes participando en la charla"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#00b6e5]/10 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-[#00b6e5] mb-3">
              PARTICIPACIÓN
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-2">Atención de los grupos</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
              Cada grupo escolar siguió la sesión con cuadernos en mano, listos para aprender y participar.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Photo 3: Demostración -->
        <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#e2e8f0] hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,212,170,0.2)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#d6f5ed] to-[#d9f3fc]">
            <img
              src="/images/charlas/echavarria-demo.jpg"
              alt="Demostración de un ejercicio frente al grupo"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#00d4aa]/10 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-[#00d4aa] mb-3">
              DEMOSTRACIÓN
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-2">Aprender haciendo</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
              Acompañamos cada concepto con una demostración práctica para que los estudiantes lo vivieran en su cuerpo.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Photo 4: Dinámica supervisada -->
        <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#e2e8f0] hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(13,75,146,0.2)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#e3f0ff] to-[#d6f5ed]">
            <img
              src="/images/charlas/echavarria-dinamica.jpg"
              alt="Estudiantes realizando ejercicios guiados"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#0d4b92]/10 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-[#0d4b92] mb-3">
              DINÁMICA
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-2">Activación en grupo</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
              Pequeñas dinámicas guiadas para romper el ritmo de la charla y mantener la energía de la sala.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Photo 5: Actividad amplia -->
        <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#e2e8f0] hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,182,229,0.2)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#d9f3fc] to-[#d6f5ed]">
            <img
              src="/images/charlas/echavarria-actividad.jpg"
              alt="Estudiantes haciendo abdominales en grupo"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#00b6e5]/10 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-[#00b6e5] mb-3">
              ACTIVIDAD
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-2">Todos al mismo tiempo</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
              Cerramos cada bloque con una rutina sencilla que el grupo entero pudiera realizar junto.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Photo 6: Certificados -->
        <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#e2e8f0] hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,212,170,0.2)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#d6f5ed] to-[#e3f0ff]">
            <img
              src="/images/charlas/echavarria-certificados.jpg"
              alt="Estudiantes con su certificado de asistencia"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-[#00d4aa]/10 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-[#00d4aa] mb-3">
              CIERRE
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-2">Certificados de asistencia</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
              Cada participante se llevó su reconocimiento como recuerdo de la Semana de la Salud.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Agradecimiento: Mural de superhéroes del Colegio Echavarría -->
  <section id="agradecimiento-echavarria" class="relative py-20 overflow-hidden scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fdf2f8] via-white to-[#e3f0ff]"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-[#ec4899] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-10"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-[#00b6e5] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-10"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ec4899]/15 to-[#00b6e5]/15 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full font-bold text-xs md:text-sm mb-5 border border-[#ec4899]/20">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#ec4899]" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3.172 5.172a4 4 0 015.656 0L10 6.343l1.172-1.171a4 4 0 115.656 5.656L10 17.657l-6.828-6.829a4 4 0 010-5.656z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
          </svg>
          UN DETALLE QUE NOS LLEGÓ AL CORAZÓN
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-[#0f172a] mb-5 leading-tight">
          Gracias, <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ec4899] to-[#00b6e5] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Colegio Jesús María Echavarría</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
          Después de la Semana de la Salud, los estudiantes prepararon este mural con tema de superhéroes
          como agradecimiento por nuestra visita. No pudimos resistirnos: el equipo de LEAR se tomó un
          ratito para posar y disfrutar del detalle. <strong>Gracias por hacernos sentir parte de su comunidad.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6">
        <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#e2e8f0] hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(236,72,153,0.2)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2">
          <div class="aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fdf2f8] to-[#fce7f3]">
            <img
              src="/images/charlas/heroes-cape.jpg"
              alt="Fisioterapeuta de LEAR posando con capa frente al mural"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#e2e8f0] hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(236,72,153,0.2)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2">
          <div class="aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#fce7f3] to-[#fdf2f8]">
            <img
              src="/images/charlas/heroes-flying.jpg"
              alt="Fisioterapeuta volando con capa de superhéroe"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group relative bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#e2e8f0] hover:shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,182,229,0.2)] transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2">
